Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.63,0:08:15.98,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Kita, with Adachi and Arakawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.98,0:08:18.38,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Edogawa, with Sumida and Koto.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.93,0:08:19.19,shopping,Sign,0,0,0,,{\1a&H4D&\bord0\move(460,191,513,191,24,2235)}Edogawa
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.93,0:08:19.19,shopping,Sign,0,0,0,,{\1a&H4D&\bord0\move(376,114,429,114,24,2235)}Sumida
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.93,0:08:19.19,shopping,Sign,0,0,0,,{\1a&H4D&\bord0\move(377,258,429,258,24,2235)}Koto
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.38,0:08:20.60,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Ota, with Meguro and Setagaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.19,0:08:21.44,shopping,Sign,0,0,0,,{\1a&H4D&\bord0\move(295,275,350,275,17,2227)}Ota
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.19,0:08:21.44,shopping,Sign,0,0,0,,{\1a&H3D&\bord0\move(320,123,375,123,17,2227)}Meguro
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.19,0:08:21.44,shopping,Sign,0,0,0,,{\1a&H4D&\bord0\move(266,22,321,22,24,2227)}Setagaya
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.60,0:08:22.83,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Shinjuku, with Toshima and Bunkyo...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.44,0:08:23.69,shopping,Sign,0,0,0,,{\1a&H4D&\bord0\move(146,254,205,254,19,2229)}Shinjuku
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.44,0:08:23.69,shopping,Sign,0,0,0,,{\1a&H4D&\bord0\move(164,46,223,46,19,2227)}Toshima
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.44,0:08:23.69,shopping,Sign,0,0,0,,{\1a&H4D&\bord0\move(193,121,252,121,19,2227)}Bunkyo
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.83,0:08:24.94,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,and finally Bunkyo, with Arakawa and Taito.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.69,0:08:24.94,shopping,Sign,0,0,0,,{\1a&H4D&\bord0\move(99,102,157,102,21,2227)}Arakawa
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.69,0:08:24.94,shopping,Sign,0,0,0,,{\1a&H4D&\bord0\move(12,197,70,197,21,2227)}Bunkyo
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.69,0:08:24.94,shopping,Sign,0,0,0,,{\1a&H4D&\bord0\move(88,199,146,199,21,2227)}Taito
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.40,0:08:28.25,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,It's like there's one outwards \Nand one inwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.25,0:08:29.28,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Precisely.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.28,0:08:36.25,Comp big-an8,Sign,0,0,0,,{\1a&H3D&\pos(64,133)}Kita
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.28,0:08:36.25,Comp big-an8,Sign,0,0,0,,{\1a&H3D&\pos(474,224)}Arakawa
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.28,0:08:36.25,Comp big-an8,Sign,0,0,0,,{\1a&H3D&\pos(496,78)}Adachi
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.96,0:08:33.32,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,If Arakawa is announced tonight, \Nwe'd be moving inwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.32,0:08:35.08,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,And if it's Adachi, we'd head outwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.08,0:08:37.34,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,We can determine the principle\N depending on the outcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.81,0:08:40.37,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Adachi would signify a route \Ncircling the outer wards.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.37,0:08:42.91,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,But that poses two irregular areas.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.91,0:08:46.58,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Yeah. Nakano was an inner adjacent \Nward, which we've already passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.58,0:08:49.60,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,And it would leave out Meguro.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.10,0:08:52.46,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,But if Arakawa were \Nto be announced tonight,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.46,0:08:57.75,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,it would mean we'd go in order from in and out \Nwhen there are multiple adjacent wards,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.75,0:09:01.56,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,just like we did from Suginami \Nto Nakano then Nerima.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.60,0:09:05.07,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,That would include all 23 wards!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.07,0:09:07.78,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,And the final destination \Nwould become Chiyoda.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.45,0:09:10.36,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,I never noticed any of this...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.36,0:09:12.86,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,But how do we know the Emperor's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.39,0:09:16.54,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Because they're searching for whoever \Nis the key to defeating the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.63,0:09:21.88,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,If you trace the steps of the Camp's \Nresearchers, it leads to Narita's accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.38,0:09:25.38,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,That's how the Emperor learned of \Na leaked "trump card" against them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.79,0:09:31.32,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Their aim is to eliminate that trump card \Nby reaching its owner, Narita.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.32,0:09:33.34,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,At least, that's what Sudo suspected.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.67,0:09:38.81,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,So everything from the starting ward \Nto the area progression all lead to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.30,0:09:40.32,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.65,0:09:45.77,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,They assumed only the owner of the trump card \Ncould determine why it started in Suginami.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.18,0:09:49.31,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,The Emperor, Tasuketsu, and Rights...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.31,0:09:53.24,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Very few people likely realize \Nthe connection between the three.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.13,0:09:57.33,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Hang on. Why go about it \Nin such a roundabout way?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.33,0:09:59.84,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,The owner of the Obedience Right died, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.84,0:10:02.50,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Which means the Emperor recovered it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.50,0:10:05.96,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Why not just use the Obedience Right \Nto force Saneatsu to meet them?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.83,0:10:08.92,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Of course. That's because...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.16,0:10:12.38,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,There's a chance the owner of \Nthe Obedience Right is still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.01,0:10:13.88,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Alive?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.49,0:10:16.26,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,I'm just saying, there's a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.26,0:10:19.35,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,But if they are, can't they \Ndefeat the Emperor?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.35,0:10:22.64,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,Or even if they're on the Emperor's \Nside, why aren't they using it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.64,0:10:24.10,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.10,0:10:25.72,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,Based on what's happened so far,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.72,0:10:30.15,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,it looks like the Emperor's only method \Nto kill us is through Tasuketsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.69,0:10:33.36,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,Or maybe they can't use the \NObedience Right for whatever reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.36,0:10:38.08,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,The answer to that is probably easiest \Nto find out from Iruga or Mido.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.08,0:10:40.52,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Okay, so what am I supposed to display?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.52,0:10:45.24,Default,Souma,0,0,0,,It's almost today's tally time. \NNot that there'll be a tally...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.24,0:10:46.14,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.73,0:10:50.49,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,In case it's useful information,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.96,0:10:53.99,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,we still have electricity, \Nwater, and radio waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.78,0:10:58.72,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Meaning it's likely the Emperor \Nneeds them too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.26,0:11:03.52,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Radio waves to conduct Tasuketsu. \NWater for obvious reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.52,0:11:05.19,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,What's a mystery is electricity.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.93,0:11:08.65,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,Ya, he can display Tasuketsu without it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.65,0:11:11.19,Default,Rika,0,0,0,,And it's not necessarily \Na lifeline, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.64,0:11:14.57,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Could it be for a security system?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.42,0:11:19.81,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Interesting. So the Emperor \Nis in a safe location.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.81,0:11:24.81,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Then we might be able to catch him \Noff guard if we turn off the power!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.20,0:11:26.44,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,I'm already on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.35,0:11:30.11,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,The majority of Tokyo's power is generated
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.11,0:11:34.77,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,at the Shinagawa Thermal Power Station \Nand the Oi Thermal Power Station.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.48,0:11:38.52,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Even if the Emperor has \Nan in-house power generator,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.52,0:11:41.52,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,a surprise attack on the two power \Nstations could temporarily cut supply.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.52,0:11:45.54,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,This would shut down their security \Nsystem, creating a brief opening.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.95,0:11:48.71,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Tonight's announcement should \Nreveal the Emperor's location
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.71,0:11:51.05,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,for us to formulate a complete plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.48,0:11:55.92,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,So we'll raid the power stations, cause \Na blackout, and head to the Emperor...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.77,0:11:59.95,Default,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,Okay, so here's the message!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.03,0:12:05.93,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Kanagawa's farther than\N I thought, Teppei-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.61,0:12:11.21,Emperor,Emperor,0,0,0,,It's time. We will not be taking tally.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.21,0:12:14.47,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Would you look at that. \NSomeone did good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.47,0:12:24.51,Comp big-an8,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFF2&\an7\fs17\bord4\3c&H5B472B&\3a&H00&}Calling all survivors. \NWe are the Resistance, in search\Nof comrades to defeat the Emperor.  \NWe have a path to victory depending\N on reinforcement.\NMeet us tomorrow at noon inside the\NCity Hall of the Designated Area.\NIf you do not wish to aid us, stay away.\NThose identified as threats will be eliminated.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.00,0:12:24.51,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Cool. A resistance, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.43,0:12:27.27,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Sounds like a fun little event!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.27,0:12:35.07,Comp big-an8,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFF2&\an7\fs17\bord4\3c&H2D2716&\3a&H00&}We have a path to victory depending\N on reinforcement.\NMeet us tomorrow at noon inside the\NCity Hall of the Designated Area.\NIf you do not wish to aid us, stay away.\NThose identified as threats will be eliminated.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.69,0:12:30.71,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Tomorrow at noon... Too bad I can't make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.09,0:12:35.51,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Hmm... I'd say they're really closing in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.51,0:12:37.69,Emperor,Emperor,0,0,0,,Now, for the announcement \Nof tomorrow's Designated Area.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.66,0:12:41.11,Emperor,Emperor,0,0,0,,Tomorrow's area is...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.07,0:12:44.12,Comp big-an8 - closeup blue,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs40\pos(321,82)}Arakawa Ward
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.93,0:12:44.12,Emperor,Emperor,0,0,0,,Arakawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.60,0:12:49.39,Italics,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,The Emperor's location is... Chiyoda!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.94,0:12:51.92,Show Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(492,245)}Tasuketsu: Fate of the Majority
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.04,0:12:58.72,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Look at this room. It's spotless!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.02,0:13:03.44,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Just what you'd expect from \Nthat overly sincere Teppei-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.99,0:13:08.12,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,I wonder if I'd change my mind \Nif he were still alive...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.55,0:13:12.98,Flashback_Italics,Teppei,0,0,0,,I don't care what Prime Right \NI have. I'll never use it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.98,0:13:16.86,Flashback_Italics,Teppei,0,0,0,,It'd basically be approving \Nwhat they've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.58,0:13:20.61,Flashback,Teppei,0,0,0,,I'll expose their evils the right way!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.12,0:13:23.14,Flashback,Teppei,0,0,0,,Justice will win, no matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.00,0:13:27.32,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,I guess you were wrong, Teppei-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.75,0:13:33.55,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,I wouldn't think everything was futile \Nif justice won in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.52,0:13:38.53,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Justice, value... All of it \Nis decided by the majority.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.85,0:13:43.13,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,It's nonsense―a mountain of prejudice \Ndisguised as the "right answer."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.53,0:13:46.22,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,I get it now that you've died, Teppei-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.69,0:13:50.06,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,There really was no such thing as justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.78,0:13:55.61,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Teppei-chan's cell phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.08,0:13:58.39,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,He always kept it on him...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.65,0:14:02.00,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,So I guess this is where he died.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.51,0:14:07.33,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,But... something's not making sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.33,0:14:10.42,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,The Emperor hasn't used the Obedience Right,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.42,0:14:14.17,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,so it's natural to assume they \Nhaven't been able to recover it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.93,0:14:19.96,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Which got my hopes up that\NTeppei-chan might still be alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.50,0:14:22.70,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,After all, I'm the only one \Nwho knew where he lived.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.70,0:14:26.10,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,I actually thought we'd make it if we \Ncould just beat Mido to the punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.30,0:14:28.76,Black-Standard,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,1)\bord0\frz-4\fax0.3\frx12\fry14\c&H897E75&\pos(382,182)}One New Voice Memo
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.05,0:14:33.97,Italics,Teppei,0,0,0,,I'm Teppei Yoshii.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.97,0:14:37.90,Italics,Teppei,0,0,0,,I'm leaving this message in case \Nsomething happens to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.42,0:14:40.61,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Teppei-chan's voice...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.53,0:14:45.74,Italics,Teppei,0,0,0,,This message is for Ren... \Nmy best friend Ren Iruga.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.74,0:14:48.92,Italics,Teppei,0,0,0,,Ren, I know you'll find \Nthis message, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.47,0:14:54.37,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,The only person stupid enough \Nto trust me is you, Teppei-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.50,0:15:00.04,Italics,Teppei,0,0,0,,Look inside "my favorite thing." \NYou'll find numbers marked.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.54,0:15:02.12,Italics,Teppei,0,0,0,,Start from one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.90,0:15:07.26,Italics,Teppei,0,0,0,,If something happens to me, \NI hope it's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.78,0:15:15.72,Italics,Iruga,0,0,0,,So that's what's going on. \NI get it now, Teppei-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.34,0:15:19.77,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,You loved music, which means...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.79,0:15:23.28,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.93,0:15:31.45,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Adhered parts of the stereo... divide.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.55,0:15:41.34,Flashback_Italics,Teppei,0,0,0,,You'll find numbers marked. Start from one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.26,0:15:46.44,Italics,Teppei,0,0,0,,For Ren,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.86,0:15:50.34,Italics,Teppei,0,0,0,,Even if I die, as long as \Nthis first envelope is safe,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.34,0:15:52.26,Italics,Teppei,0,0,0,,the Obedience Right will belong to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.95,0:15:57.55,Italics,Teppei,0,0,0,,Envelopes two through five each \Ncontain a simple command.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.11,0:16:02.27,Italics,Teppei,0,0,0,,They'll only work once against \Nthe first person who sees them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.93,0:16:06.31,Italics,Teppei,0,0,0,,How they should be used is something \NI'll leave for you to decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.76,0:16:12.02,Italics,Teppei,0,0,0,,I believe in you to finish the rest... \Nsince you're my best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.17,0:16:15.87,Italics,Teppei,0,0,0,,The commands written in \Nenvelopes two through five are...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.86,0:16:23.14,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Can you imagine if someone \Nother than me found these?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.14,0:16:25.49,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,All this work without your eyesight...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.49,0:16:27.84,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Did you even consider someone \Nusing this for their own benefit?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.27,0:16:32.16,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Teppei-chan, you're a bit of a dope \Nfor someone so sincere.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.74,0:16:35.32,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Although, I didn't mind that about you...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.68,0:16:39.44,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Thanks to you, I may just \Nchange my mind about the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.97,0:16:41.69,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.07,0:16:43.97,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Mido's definitely out of the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.97,0:16:46.90,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,But I dunno if I'm cut out for it, either...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.90,0:16:49.86,Flashback,Saneatsu,0,0,0,,I'll defeat the Emperor \Nand put an end to Tasuketsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.28,0:16:52.60,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Oh, right...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.60,0:16:55.33,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,He'd be perfect for the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.62,0:16:58.71,Italics,Iruga,0,0,0,,Teppei-chan's only keepsake...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.53,0:17:01.22,Italics,Iruga,0,0,0,,I won't let anyone near it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.67,0:17:03.21,Italics,Iruga,0,0,0,,I'll keep it safe as long as I live.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.45,0:17:11.70,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Now, let's go pass down \NTeppei-chan's justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.05,0:17:15.56,White-Standard,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(329,226)\frz351\fax0.15\c&H867A6A&\3c&H000000&\3a&H95&}Arakawa City Hall
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.18,0:17:28.91,Default,Shimomura,0,0,0,,Are you guys the ones who sent that message?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.91,0:17:29.81,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.81,0:17:31.93,Default,Shimomura,0,0,0,,Damn it! They're just a bunch of kids!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.93,0:17:35.41,Default,Hikari,0,0,0,,Just to be safe... You aren't \Nthe Emperor, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.41,0:17:37.74,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Nuh-uh! Why'd you ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.74,0:17:41.08,Default,Hikari,0,0,0,,How were you able to send that message then?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.08,0:17:44.50,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,With my Right... the Presentation Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.98,0:17:48.46,Default,Saaya,0,0,0,,We found a way to defeat the Emperor, \Nso we're looking for reinforcements.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.16,0:17:50.32,Default,Agatsuma,0,0,0,,{\i1}Defeat{\i0} the Emperor?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.32,0:17:51.63,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,I-Is that true?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.63,0:17:55.16,Default,Shimomura,0,0,0,,C'mon, don't believe them! Remember...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.16,0:17:58.24,Default,Shimomura,0,0,0,,We came here desperate with the \Nhope of defeating the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.24,0:17:59.98,Default,Shimomura,0,0,0,,We risked our lives to get here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.37,0:18:01.64,Default,Shimomura,0,0,0,,And {\i1}this{\i0} is what we get?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.64,0:18:03.69,Default,Shimomura,0,0,0,,A bunch of {\i1}kids{\i0}?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.57,0:18:08.90,Default,Agatsuma,0,0,0,,Y-You're right... There's no way \Nwe can take your word!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.90,0:18:12.86,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,Hang on a sec... What if these guys \Nare the Emperor's pawns?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.32,0:18:15.71,Default,Hikari,0,0,0,,Well?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.71,0:18:16.74,Default,Shimomura,0,0,0,,Answer us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.21,0:18:20.45,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,You all! Straighten up and be quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.65,0:18:25.04,Default,Shimomura,0,0,0,,H-Hey... Why am I...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.04,0:18:26.88,Default,Agatsuma,0,0,0,,My body... won't listen...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.88,0:18:32.38,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,The strongest Prime Right \Nof Obedience... belongs to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.33,0:18:36.36,Default,Shimomura,0,0,0,,The Obedience Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.19,0:18:38.81,Default,Shimomura,0,0,0,,Wha—?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.66,0:18:45.79,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,My Prime Right is the \NPhysical Manipulation Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.79,0:18:47.77,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,If I wanted to kill ya, \NI'd have already done it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.77,0:18:51.06,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,We've got chops and a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.57,0:18:53.65,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,All we need is a bigger headcount.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.97,0:18:57.78,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Which is why we called \Nfor gutsy people like you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.29,0:19:00.40,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,I hope you'll trust us and lend us your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.24,0:19:04.00,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,But if you can't, go ahead and leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.32,0:19:13.23,Default,Shimomura,0,0,0,,Fine, I trust you. \NIt's the only hand we've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.22,0:19:18.91,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,Yeah! With your powers, I'm sure \Nwe can defeat the Emperor!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.91,0:19:22.56,Default,Agatsuma,0,0,0,,So, what exactly is this plan of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.90,0:19:27.04,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,We'd ask you guys \Nto take on the safest roles.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.67,0:19:29.27,Default,Hikari,0,0,0,,Safest?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.27,0:19:31.60,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Ones that don't require any Rights.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.60,0:19:32.53,Default,Shimomura,0,0,0,,Huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.42,0:19:38.32,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Also, we need an Assistant Officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.32,0:19:39.98,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,Assistant Officer?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.98,0:19:42.08,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Any volunteers?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.76,0:19:46.92,Default,Mido,0,0,0,,I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.73,0:19:50.38,Default,Mido,0,0,0,,I'd be happy to—actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.18,0:19:54.76,Default,Mido,0,0,0,,I {\i1}demand{\i0} to.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.48,0:20:01.06,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Perfect. It's decided, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.04,0:20:22.83,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,You four can climb to \Nthe rooftop and wait there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.83,0:20:23.73,Default,Shimomura,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.73,0:20:25.84,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,Hey! What's that about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.29,0:20:29.74,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Don't worry. This building's safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.05,0:20:38.83,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Our comrades that can \Nspot enemies are on guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.47,0:20:45.22,Default,Mido,0,0,0,,Well, well... what a bold strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.22,0:20:48.02,Default,Mido,0,0,0,,It was worth dragging \Nmy feet here, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.52,0:20:51.56,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Shut up while you walk... Mido!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.96,0:21:13.88,Default,Mido,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.88,0:21:18.94,Default,Mido,0,0,0,,Sanetomo Narita's\Ndear son...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.92,0:21:19.92,Next Ep Title,Sign,0,0,0,,Pass Down
